Other markets
</strong>
<br>
Quote our exchange or another marketplace
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6">
<div class="bullet-panel">
<span class="icon-check-solid"></span>
<strong>Real time last price</strong>
<br>
Stream a real time last sale price (based on exchange fees)
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-12">
<p class="mt-3 text-center">Need Real-Time Data? Add real-time to your quotes on Toronto Stock Exchange or TSX Venture Exchange at no additional cost by sending this completed <a href="https://www.tsx.com/en/resource/2908/" target="_blank">agreement</a> to your vendor.</p>
</div>
</div>
