<div class="ac alerts">
<h2 class="ac-header">
<button class="ac-trigger">Email Alerts</button>
</h2>
<div class="ac-panel">
<div class="container email-alerts">
<div class="col-md-6">
<p>
Our Investor Relations Alerts service is an additional feature that makes it easy for companies to communicate
to
investors about key company updates.
</p>
<p>
Features Available: News Alert, End of Day Price Alert, Corporate Events Alert (Includes: Dividends, Earnings,
Splits)
The IR Alerts Module can be styled to match that of your company website. When a subscriber verifies their email
address, we'll send them email alerts directly according to their subscription type(s).
</p>
</div>
